# AR Hydraulics and Sealing Solutions — environment configuration
#
# The quote and contact forms submit to the Cloudflare Worker's /api/enquiry
# endpoint (worker/), which sends via the Resend HTTPS API and verifies
# Cloudflare Turnstile server-side.
#
# These are NOT read by `next build` (except the NEXT_PUBLIC_* one) — they
# are Cloudflare Worker configuration. Set the secrets below with
# `wrangler secret put <NAME>` (or the Cloudflare dashboard), never in a
# committed .env file.
#
# Never commit real values for these variables — this file only documents
# the keys that are required.

# --- Worker secrets (wrangler secret put <NAME>) ---
# Resend API key used to send the enquiry email.
# EMAIL_API_KEY=

# Cloudflare Turnstile secret key, verified server-side in the Worker.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=

# --- Worker vars (non-secret; already set in wrangler.jsonc "vars") ---
# Authenticated sender address (must be a domain verified in Resend).
# EMAIL_FROM=AR Hydraulics Website <enquiries@mail.arhydraulicssolutions.com>

# Fixed recipient — never taken from the browser/request.
# CONTACT_FORM_RECIPIENT=sales@arhydraulicssolutions.com

# --- Next.js public build variable (baked into the client bundle; the
# Turnstile site key is designed to be public — never put the matching
# secret key here) ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# Optional: Google Maps JavaScript API key (only needed if the embedded map
# is upgraded from the current no-key iframe embed to the JS Maps SDK)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
